LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
LOCK STEERING TO R(0,0,-90) + HEADING(90,90).
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:THRUST > 270.
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:THRUST = 0.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 0.
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:ALTITUDE > 42000.
STAGE.
WAIT 0.5.
LOCK THROTTLE TO 1.
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:ALTITUDE > 145000.
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:THRUST = 0.
WAIT 0.5.
SET KUNIVERSE:TIMEWARP:MODE TO "RAILS".
SET KUNIVERSE:TIMEWARP:WARP TO 2.
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:ALTITUDE > (SHIP:APOAPSIS - 1000).
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:ALTITUDE < 200000.
SET KUNIVERSE:TIMEWARP:WARP TO 1.
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:ALTITUDE < 160000.
SET KUNIVERSE:TIMEWARP:WARP TO 0.
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:ALTITUDE < 140000.
WAIT 0.5.
ship:parts[0]:getmodule("HardDrive"):DOEVENT("transfer data here").
STAGE.
WAIT UNTIL SHIP:ALTITUDE < 20000.
STAGE.